# Integration / runtime-dependent test patterns (ctest -R/-E regex, matched
# against "Suite.Test" names). These need a real runtime that the plain unit
# CI does not provide — an external gRPC server, a ROS graph, multi-participant
# DDS discovery timing, or a docker container — so they are split out of the
# unit lane (run_unittest.sh excludes them) and run in a separate integration
# lane (run_integration.sh runs only them), mirroring the HMI ci.yml split of
# unit-test vs integration vs ros-e2e jobs.
#
# Keep this as ONE extended-regex on a single logical line (comments/blank
# lines are stripped by the runners). Add new integration tests here.
#
# ── whole integration suites ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#  GrpcTransportTest            : opens a real gRPC channel to localhost:5443
#  ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest / LifecycleAdswIntegrationTest : real DDS pub→sub
#  NOTE: *AutowareE2ETest / L3AutowareE2ETest are NO LONGER in the integration lane.
#        They use the mock image (mmf-autoware-mock:humble, 760MB) and run in the
#        unit lane with fast-skip when prerequisites are absent. See:
#        docker/test/Dockerfile.autoware-mock and autoware_e2e_common.h.
# ── specific runtime/flaky tests inside otherwise-unit suites ──────────────
#  MessageTransmitterTest .*ROS : ROS-forwarding paths need a ROS graph
#  DDSProtocolTest .*_with_(reader|writer) : 실 DDS DataReader/DataWriter 생성·해제
#                                 (UnsubscribeMessage_TC003_with_reader 등은 단위
#                                  환경에서 90s timeout/hang), + 특정 xcdr 직렬화 케이스
#  GrpcProviderTest (whole)     : background subscribe/set worker-thread timing
#                                 (SetValueSuccess / SubscribeFailsWithErrorResponse
#                                  flake across runs) — gRPC stub is mocked but the
#                                  provider drives a worker thread.
#  VssSubscriptionManagerTest.SubscriptionWithPathsFilter : period-timer timing
#  OtamActorServiceTest.F012_.. : actor signal/timeout thread timing
# ── adsw_manager ROS2 extension — runtime-dependent tests ─────────────────
#  ContainerDockerComposeTest (4 tests) : StartComposeContainer_Success_IT010 /
#                                 GetContainerStatusStr_Running_IT011 /
#                                 StopComposeContainer_Success_IT012 /
#                                 RestartComposeContainer_IT013
#                                 — invoke `docker compose` subprocess at runtime
#  ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest (3 tests) : OnDataAvailable_DirectCall_ReadFails /
#                                 OnDataAvailable_MultipleCalls /
#                                 InitializeAndFinalize
#                                 — require real FastDDS DataReader participant
#
# ── 여기서 뺀 것 (순수 mock 으로 확인됨) ───────────────────────────────────
#  ADSWManagerTest 5종 (InitializeAndStartStop / InitializeMultipleTimes /
#    StartAndStopMultipleTimes / Process_InStartedState* /
#    Process_UpdateServiceListRequestFails*) 과
#  ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest.Testable_* 3종.
#
#  "real ROS2 DDS participant + graph 가 필요하다" 고 적혀 있었지만 실측하면
#  전부 링크 심 mock 만 쓰고 1ms 안에 끝난다. 결정적 근거는 **같은 픽스처의
#  나머지 테스트가 이미 유닛 레인에서 돌고 있다**는 것이다 (ADSWManagerTest 24종,
#  ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest 20종). DDS 가 필요했다면 그쪽도 못 돌았을 것이다.
#
#  이 8종은 실제로는 낡아서 실패하던 테스트였고 (구현이 F013 에서 바뀌었는데
#  기대치가 따라가지 못함), 이 목록에 들어간 뒤로는 유닛 레인에서 제외되고
#  runnable 목록에는 없어서 **어느 레인도 돌리지 않아** 드러나지 않았다.
#  테스트를 고쳤으므로 (커밋 08fa8f0) 유닛 레인으로 되돌린다.
#
#  주의: 이 정규식은 부분일치다. 이름을 Process_InStartedState 에서
#  Process_InStartedState_SendsRequestAndKeepsState 로 바꿔도 옛 패턴이 남아
#  있으면 계속 제외된다. 그래서 패턴 자체를 지웠다.
GrpcTransportTest\.|ConcreteEndpointIntegrationTest\.|LifecycleAdswIntegrationTest\.|MessageTransmitterTest\..*ROS|DDSProtocolTest\..*_with_(reader|writer)|DDSProtocolDeserializeTest\.Deserialize_Direct_TC016_sequence_string|DDSProtocolBranchCoverageTest\.register_type_object_TC003_comprehensive_sequence|GrpcProviderTest\.|VssSubscriptionManagerTest\.SubscriptionWithPathsFilter|OtamActorServiceTest\.F012_AllSignalsBeforeTimeout_NoTimeout|ContainerDockerComposeTest\.(StartComposeContainer_Success_IT010|GetContainerStatusStr_Running_IT011|StopComposeContainer_Success_IT012|RestartComposeContainer_IT013)|ROSDiscoveryInfoEndpointTest\.(OnDataAvailable_DirectCall_ReadFails|OnDataAvailable_MultipleCalls|InitializeAndFinalize)
